  <title>ASSERT Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>Debugging</keyword>
    <keyword>ASSERT command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">ASSERT Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Purpose</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">Displays a message box when the specified expression evaluates to FALSE.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Syntax</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">ASSERT &lt;lExpression&gt; [MESSAGE &lt;cMessageText&gt;]</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Arguments</para>
    <para styleclass="List">&lt;lExpression&gt;<tab />The expression that is evaluated. Nothing happens when the expression returns TRUE.</para>
    <para styleclass="List">MESSAGE &lt;cMessageText&gt;<tab />The text that is displayed in the message box. When this clause is omitted, the text of the expression is displayed.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Remarks</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">ASSERT only does something when <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_ASSERTS">SET ASSERTS</link> is ON. When the assertion fails, a dialog is shown with the options Debug, Cancel, Ignore and Ignore All. Ignore All suppresses all following failed assertions.</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">When the compiler define NOASSERT is declared, the ASSERT commands are removed from the code by the preprocessor.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Examples</para>
    <para styleclass="Code Example">SET ASSERTS ON<br/>
ASSERT nCount &gt; 0 MESSAGE "The count must be positive"</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">See Also</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_ASSERTS">SET ASSERTS</link></para>
  </body>
